  "solution": "BODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nGiven equation: 17 B 17 C 324 A 9 D 22 = ?\n\nNow, if ‘A’ = ‘÷’, ‘B’ = ‘×’, ‘C’ = ‘+’ and ‘D’ = ‘−’, then:\n\n⇒ 17 × 17 + 324 ÷ 9 − 22 = ?\n\n⇒ __**17 × 17**__ + __**324 ÷ 9**__ − 22 = ?\n\n⇒ __**289**__ + __**36**__ − 22 = ?\n\n⇒ __**289 + 36**__ − 22 = ?\n\n⇒ __**325 − 22**__ = __**303**__.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 2\".",
